  "description": "BarcodeLib - A barcode library to quickly create UPC-E barcode and other barcodes on PowerPoint (.pptx) with comprehensive options to customize the ISO compatible barcodes.\n\nThis package includes detailed example C# source code to generate UPC-E on PowerPoint (.pptx) in .NET projects.\n\n\nDocuments\n==============================\nC# How to Guide : https://www.barcodelib.com/csharp/\nTutorials \n     ASP.NET Core : https://www.barcodelib.com/csharp/create-barcode-asp-net-core.html\n     ASP.NET Core MVC : https://www.barcodelib.com/csharp/create-barcode-asp-net-core-mvc.html\n     ASP.NET Framework : https://www.barcodelib.com/asp_net/barcode_aspnet_csharp.html\n     Windows Forms : https://www.barcodelib.com/net_winforms/barcode_net_winforms_csharp.html\n     WPF : https://www.barcodelib.com/csharp/create-barcode-wpf.html\nEmail : support@barcodelib.com",
